notes.content:
New:
- Added Steam Achievements;
- Reworked the movement system;
- Reworked the teleport visualisation;
- Reworked the VR menu.

Bufixes:
- Fixed menu sounds;
- Fixed bug with the sound spheres;
- Small fixes.

New:
- Added the activation of sound spheres by touching them;
- Added a text about the necessary change of colour scheme;
- Changed the UI;
- Changed a pointer on the controller.

Bugfixes:
- Fixed bug with room collision;
- Fixed angle of controller tilt;
- Small fixes.

New:
- Added menu in the VR mode;
- Added a function to skip the ending video;
- Added different movement speeds.

Bugfixes:
- Fixed a bug with changing the screen resolution;
- Fixed collision in room 008;
- And other small fixes.

New:
- Added static lighting;
- Added feature to change the type of lighting in the settings to optimise performance;
- Added information about keyboard controls;
- Reworked UI in the main menu.

Bug fixes:
- Fixed a bug with a cursor switching;
- And other small fixes.

New:
- Added settings for graphics, sound and mouse sensitivity;
- Added camera zoom;
- Added Pico headsets support in SteamVR;
- Added a teleport from the lower point of room 002 back up.

Bug fixes:
- Fixed OpenXR support in SteamVR;
- Fixed a voice message feature  — the messages from Maxim do not finish abruptly when the idle mode is on;
- Fixed sun movement;
- Fixed bug with a teleportation via the map;
- Fixed bug with instant switching between adjacent rooms;
- And other small fixes.
